value.literal_statement:
Let $C_{m,n}$ be the square-grid cylinder, let $Z(C_{m,n})$ be the hard-particle partition function at activity $-1$, and suppose that $n$ is odd. **Jonsson's cylinder partition-function conjecture.** For all odd $n$,

$$
Z(C_{m,n})=
\begin{cases}
-2 & \text{if }3\mid\gcd(m-1,n),\\
1 & \text{otherwise.}
\end{cases}
$$

The conjecture is based on computations for $m\leq11$; the source does not state a resolution.

